  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186083201,
      "id": "dc6d9b69-0459-515a-ba7b-c62cab96ca00",
      "title": "Identifying Divergent Improper Integrals"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "ca51e9a1-cb2a-5d4c-a733-923071c11671",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following improper integrals are divergent?\n- **I.** ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-2}\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}u$\n- **II.** ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{(z+3)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}z$\n- **III.** ${\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's work out each integral.\n\nFor the first integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-2}\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}u & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{-2}\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[-\\frac{1}{2{u}^{2}}]}_{a}^{-2} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(-\\frac{1}{2(-2)^{2}}+\\frac{1}{2{a}^{2}}) \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(\\frac{1}{2{a}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral is convergent.\n\nFor the second integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{(z+3)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}z & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}\\frac{1}{(z+3)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[-\\frac{1}{z+3}]}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(-\\frac{1}{a+3}+\\frac{1}{0+3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral is convergent.\n\nFor the third integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{4}^{a}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|]_{4}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(\\operatorname{ln}⁡a-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4) \\\\  & =\\infty ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral diverges.\n\nIn conclusion, only integrals III is divergent.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "66a11e08-8412-5554-a1a0-a45400763c10",
